  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards use the game's own champion-icon resolver with per-champion full-leg framing above the native level selector. Yone now has a reference-grounded articulated upright cross-step run cycle with alternating arms, legs and both swords, plus a one-second Fate Sealed presentation aligned to the real rush tick with distinct wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo stages. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required to embed the current Yone action tree.",
